body:
@PlNG, just to clarify your desired functionality for the `quotes` is:

``` js
// "quotes": [1, "double"]
var foo = 'I am single quoted.'; // fail
var foo = '"I am single quoted, but have double quotes inside."'; // pass

// "quotes": [1, "single"]
var foo = "I am double quoted."; // fail
var foo = "'I am double quoted, but have single quotes inside.'"; // pass
var foo = "I'm double quoted, but have a single quote as an apostrophe."; // pass?
```
